#. placeholders: {per_hour}
msgid ""
"Quick off the line and tops out near {per_hour}. Its big hop clears curbs."
msgstr ""
"Scatta subito e arriva quasi a {per_hour}. Il suo salto alto supera i "
"cordoli."

msgid "Knobbly tyres for cobbles, potholes and rain. Its hop clears curbs."
msgstr ""
"Gomme tassellate per pavé, buche e pioggia. Il suo saltello supera i "
"cordoli."

#. placeholders: {per_hour}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "A motor helps you up to {per_hour}."
msgstr "Un motore ti aiuta fino a {per_hour}."

#. placeholders: {per_hour}
msgid ""
"A motor helps you up to {per_hour}. Its hop cannot clear a curb, and "
"potholes flatten its tyres."
msgstr ""
