"Press {control_name} again, and let go right at the top of the swing."
msgstr ""
"Premi di nuovo {control_name}, e lascia la palla proprio in cima allo swing."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The swing ran out."
msgstr "Lo swing è finito."

#. placeholders: {control_name}
msgid ""
"The swing ran out. Press {control_name} again, and let go right at the top "
