msgid "Data core, {story_stage} of {LOGS}"
msgstr "Nucleo dati, {story_stage} su {LOGS}"

msgid "The skimmer's own logs, recovered run by run and as intel adds up."
msgstr ""
"I registri dello skimmer, recuperati partita dopo partita e man mano che si "
