"score, so the pantry's board never changes. Once a pantry has closed, Play "
"again on its results says so and does not start it. A treat is eaten with "
"the crumb in its cell. Space plays the nearest treat after the crumb cues, "
"from where it hides, and names where it is. S counts the treats left, and H "
"names the way to the nearest one."
msgstr ""
